Rym: So I briefly, in college, dated someone who actually knew how to knife fight for real and had taken classes and learned this because this person's mother was a private investigator who needed to know about that because being a PI is actually kind of a really dangerous job and there's a whole side story I'm not going to get into, but I was curious and taught me and I learned a little bit about how knife fights actually work in the real world from someone who knew what they were talking about.

518
00:52:59,206 --> 00:53:07,490
Rym: and if I had to summarize everything I learned the moral of knife fighting is never ever ever get in a knife fight.

519
00:53:08,237 --> 00:53:13,246
Rym: Everyone involved in a knife fight, but everyone involved in any knife fight gets cut badly.

520
00:53:13,589 --> 00:53:18,159
Rym: There is no universe where you are in a knife fight and you are not cut even if you win.

521
00:53:18,940 --> 00:53:21,094
Rym: Knife fights are the worst possible fights.

522
00:53:22,321 --> 00:53:32,199
